  "summary": "Charlottesville Police Chief Mike Kochis told City Council the department is pausing use of the Peregrine data integration system after citizen complaints and has disconnected its Flock ALPR system from outside sources, restricting Flock data access to local personnel only. Kochis defended Flock's role in solving violent crimes while acknowledging concerns about nationwide data sharing.",
